# What Are You Assessing? General Education and the Humanities Curriculum.

**Authors:** Helm, Thomas E.

## Abstract
Discusses the challenges faced at Western Illinois University to develop a general education assessment framework in the humanities. Stresses the importance of interpretation in all the humanities, assessment goals that focus on students' understanding of humanistic discourse, and ability to use at least one discipline's mode of interpretation and representative concepts. (DB)

